{
  "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q11",
  "school": "京都大学",
  "year": "2025",
  "subject": "情报学研究科_数理工学",
  "text": "设 $f(t)=-\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}, g(t)=0$，求常微分方程 $\\dfrac{d^2x}{dt^2}+f(t)\\dfrac{dx}{dt}+g(t)x=0$ 的一般解。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "降阶法",
    "变量分离",
    "缺项二阶线性方程"
  ],
  "method": [
    "令 $v=x'$ 降为一阶方程再用变量分离法求解"
  ],
  "question_type": "缺 $x$ 项二阶线性ODE求解",
  "solution_steps": [
    "代入具体的 $f,g$ 得方程 $x''-\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}x'=0$",
    "设 $v=x'$，化为一阶变量分离方程",
    "求解 $v(t)$，再积分求 $x(t)$"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "order_reduction_missing_x",
    "template": "x''-\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}x'=0",
    "variable_count": 0
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "一般解",
      "steps": [
        "方程为 $x''-\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}x'=0$，不显含 $x$，令 $v=x'$，得一阶方程 $v'=\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}v$",
        "变量分离：$\\dfrac{dv}{v}=\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}dt$，两边积分：$\\ln|v|=\\ln(1+t^2)+C$，故 $v=C_1(1+t^2)$",
        "由 $x'=C_1(1+t^2)$，积分得 $x(t)=C_1\\left(t+\\dfrac{t^3}{3}\\right)+C_2$",
        "验证：对 $x=t+t^3/3$求导，$x'=1+t^2$，$x''=2t$；代入原方程 $2t-\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}(1+t^2)=2t-2t=0$，成立"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "求方程 $x''-\\dfrac{1}{t}x'=0$（$t>0$）的一般解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "降阶法",
        "变量分离"
      ],
      "question_type": "缺 $x$ 项ODE求解",
      "method": [
        "降阶法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "令 $v=x'$",
        "变量分离求 $v$",
        "积分求 $x$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "order_reduction_missing_x",
        "template": "x''-\\dfrac1t x'=0",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令 $v=x'$，$v'=v/t$，分离变量 $dv/v=dt/t$，积分 $\\ln|v|=\\ln t+C$，$v=C_1t$",
            "$x'=C_1t$，积分 $x=C_1t^2/2+C_2$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q11-practice-01",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求方程 $x''+\\dfrac{1}{t}x'=0$（$t>0$）的一般解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "降阶法",
        "变量分离"
      ],
      "question_type": "缺 $x$ 项ODE求解",
      "method": [
        "降阶法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "令 $v=x'$",
        "求解一阶方程",
        "积分求 $x$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "order_reduction_missing_x",
        "template": "x''+\\dfrac1t x'=0",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令 $v=x'$，$v'=-v/t$，分离变量得 $v=C_1/t$",
            "$x'=C_1/t$，积分 $x=C_1\\ln t+C_2$"
          ]
        }
      ],
