    {
      "text": "求方程 $x''-\\dfrac{4t}{1+t^2}x'=0$ 的一般解，并与原题结果比较系数结构的差异。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "降阶法",
        "变量分离",
        "参数比较"
      ],
      "question_type": "缺 $x$ 项ODE求解",
      "method": [
        "降阶法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "令 $v=x'$降阶",
        "分离变量求 $v$",
        "积分求 $x$，并比较与原题（系数2t/(1+t²)）的差异"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "order_reduction_missing_x",
        "template": "x''-\\dfrac{4t}{1+t^2}x'=0",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令 $v=x'$，$v'=\\dfrac{4t}{1+t^2}v$，分离变量 $\\ln|v|=2\\ln(1+t^2)+C$，即 $v=C_1(1+t^2)^2$",
            "$x'=C_1(1+t^2)^2=C_1(1+2t^2+t^4)$，积分得 $x=C_1\\left(t+\\dfrac{2t^3}{3}+\\dfrac{t^5}{5}\\right)+C_2$",
            "比较：原题系数为2t/(1+t²)导致 $v\\propto(1+t^2)^1$，而此处系数为4t/(1+t²)导致 $v\\propto(1+t^2)^2$，说明系数中 $2k\\cdot t/(1+t^2)$ 型对应 $v\\propto(1+t^2)^k$ 的规律"
          ]
        }
      ],
